			"notes": "### Fix cross-version localization build\n- Return mutable localized components so formatted death-waypoint chat messages retain the supported styling API.\\n- Use the compatibility screen lookup for asynchronous exploration statistics, including Minecraft 26.2 and later.\\n- Bump the mod version to 1.4.6-alpha for this build fix.\n\n### Add localization and waypoint organization\n- Add English and Turkish language resources and route the map, settings, waypoint, layered-view, and exploration-statistics UI text through localized keys.\\n- Add a saved language preference with Minecraft-language, English, and Turkish modes; automatically fall back to en_us when a selected locale file or individual key is unavailable.\\n- Add waypoint categories and notes to waypoint editing, local persistence, public waypoint payloads, search, and context-menu details.\\n- Add saved exploration statistics by dimension and expose them from map settings.\\n- Bump the mod version to 1.4.5-alpha."
		},
